
---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Journal — Antemundane sprǣc"
    description="A personal space for essays, questions, and reflections."
>
    <section class="subject-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">A SPACE FOR THOUGHT</p>

        <h1>Journal</h1>

        <p class="subject-introduction">
            Not every idea belongs to a particular discipline.
            This journal is a space for independent thoughts,
            questions, arguments, and reflections about the world
            and our place within it.
        </p>

        <p class="subject-secondary">
            Think. Write. Reflect. Discover.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-explore">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE JOURNAL</p>
            <h2>Three ways to express an idea</h2>
            <p>
                Some thoughts become essays, some begin as questions,
                and others remain personal reflections.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject-branches">
            <a class="subject-branch" href="/journal/essays/">
                <span class="branch-number">01</span>
                <h3>Essays</h3>
                <p>
                    Longer explorations of ideas, arguments,
                    observations, and intellectual interests.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Read essays →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/journal/questions/">
                <span class="branch-number">02</span>
                <h3>Questions</h3>
                <p>
                    Interesting problems and unanswered questions
                    worth investigating.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Explore questions →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/journal/reflections/">
                <span class="branch-number">03</span>
                <h3>Reflections</h3>
                <p>
                    Shorter thoughts, personal observations,
                    and reflections on different ideas.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Read reflections →</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-questions">
        <p class="eyebrow">A THOUGHT TO BEGIN WITH</p>
        <h2>Why keep a journal?</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Some ideas deserve to be explored beyond the boundaries of a single subject.</li>
            <li>Writing can reveal gaps in our own understanding.</li>
            <li>An unanswered question can be the beginning of an interesting journey.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
